{"id":"n65400-1-4","stage":2,"title":"수백 · 数百","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n65400-1-4-1","ko":"자동차는 참 복잡한 거 같아.","zh":"汽车真是件很复杂的东西啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"자동차는","meaning":"汽车","explanation":"자동차：汽车；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"자동차","audio":"/audio/716907a2f49c42607a15.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70799","senseId":"1","lemma":"자동차","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"참","meaning":"真，实在，的确","explanation":"참：真，实在，的确","readings":[{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71761","senseId":"1","lemma":"참","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"복잡한","meaning":"复杂，繁杂，混乱","explanation":"복잡하다：复杂，繁杂，混乱；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"복잡하다","audio":"/audio/810e6e796e934adeb9ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66274","senseId":"1","lemma":"복잡하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"716907a2f49c4260","term":"자동차","zh":"汽车","audio":"/audio/716907a2f49c42607a15.mp3","entryId":"70799","definition":"用引擎的力量转动轮胎，在道路上行驶的车。","pronunciation":["자동차"]},{"id":"8e09b5f4c09195e3","term":"참","zh":"真，实在，的确","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3","entryId":"71761","definition":"毫不违背事实或道理，真正地。","pronunciation":["참"]},{"id":"810e6e796e934ade","term":"복잡하다","zh":"复杂，繁杂，混乱","audio":"/audio/810e6e796e934adeb9ba.mp3","entryId":"66274","definition":"事情、情感等错综复杂，难以理清。","pronunciation":["복짜파다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/d542f1737cc966f38900.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n65400-1-4-2","ko":"맞아. 수백의 부품으로 만들어져 있지.","zh":"对啊，它是由数百个零件组成的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"맞아.","meaning":"对，中","explanation":"맞다：对，中；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"맞다","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66231","senseId":"2","lemma":"맞다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"수백의","meaning":"数百","explanation":"수백：数百；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"수백","audio":"/audio/31b84544eb57fd1c413e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65400","senseId":"1","lemma":"수백","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"부품으로","meaning":"零件，配件，元件","explanation":"부품：零件，配件，元件；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"부품","audio":"/audio/abdef91e78abe9773d2b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26505","senseId":"1","lemma":"부품","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"만들어져","meaning":"制作，做，制造；表示成为前面表达的那样。","explanation":"만들다：制作，做，制造；지다：表示成为前面表达的那样。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"만들다","audio":"/audio/3c159cf2a6420ca9bda5.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60317","senseId":"1","lemma":"만들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"2","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있지.","meaning":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","explanation":"있다：某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"6d08580e9b088153","term":"맞다","zh":"对，中","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3","entryId":"66231","definition":"言语、六感或事实等没有错。","pronunciation":["맏따"]},{"id":"31b84544eb57fd1c","term":"수백","zh":"数百","audio":"/audio/31b84544eb57fd1c413e.mp3","entryId":"65400","definition":"百的几倍的数目。","pronunciation":["수ː백"]},{"id":"abdef91e78abe977","term":"부품","zh":"零件，配件，元件","audio":"/audio/abdef91e78abe9773d2b.mp3","entryId":"26505","definition":"机器等整体设备中的某一组成部分。","pronunciation":["부품"]},{"id":"3c159cf2a6420ca9","term":"만들다","zh":"制作，做，制造","audio":"/audio/3c159cf2a6420ca9bda5.mp3","entryId":"60317","definition":"使用气力或技术而使没有的东西生成。","pronunciation":["만들다"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的那样。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的那样。","pronunciation":["지다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/67b5fd64b59c3ac7aa0e.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.395,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=65400","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":79,"sequenceScore":2.2217,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["对啊，它是由数百个零件组成的。","天气这么冷，把拉链拉上怎么样？","汽车真是件很复杂的东西啊。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["对啊，它是由数百个零件组成的。","汽车真是件很复杂的东西啊。","天气这么冷，把拉链拉上怎么样？"],"answer":0}]}
